<===> README.md
In compressed mode, blocks that only contain (non-preserved) comments
are invisible and must be omitted, like dart-sass does. LibSass emitted
them as empty blocks (`a{}`, `@media screen{}`). `preserved_comment` and
`unknown_at_rule` are controls. Expected output generated with dart-sass
1.93.1.
<===>
================================================================================
<===> keyframe_block/options.yml
:output_style: compressed

<===> keyframe_block/input.scss
@keyframes k {
  from {/* c */}
  to {o: 1}
}
<===> keyframe_block/output.css
@keyframes k{to{o:1}}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> media/options.yml
:output_style: compressed

<===> media/input.scss
@media screen {/* c */}
a {b: c}
<===> media/output.css
a{b:c}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> media_with_empty_rule/options.yml
:output_style: compressed

<===> media_with_empty_rule/input.scss
@media print {
  a {/* c */}
}
b {c: d}
<===> media_with_empty_rule/output.css
b{c:d}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> nested_style_rule/options.yml
:output_style: compressed

<===> nested_style_rule/input.scss
a {
  b {/* c */}
  c: d;
}
<===> nested_style_rule/output.css
a{c:d}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> preserved_comment/options.yml
:output_style: compressed

<===> preserved_comment/input.scss
a {/*! c */}
b {c: d}
<===> preserved_comment/output.css
a{/*! c */}b{c:d}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> style_rule/options.yml
:output_style: compressed

<===> style_rule/input.scss
a {/* c */}
b {c: d}
<===> style_rule/output.css
b{c:d}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> supports/options.yml
:output_style: compressed

<===> supports/input.scss
@supports (display: grid) {/* c */}
a {b: c}
<===> supports/output.css
a{b:c}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> unknown_at_rule/options.yml
:output_style: compressed

<===> unknown_at_rule/input.scss
@foo {/* c */}
a {b: c}
<===> unknown_at_rule/output.css
@foo{}a{b:c}
